  "email_body_plain": "结论：CARE-DPR Gate A-R2 的候选级局部重建与组件仲裁修复已经完成；证据来自独立 train-side diagnostic cases，formal fold0 仍未授权。下一步只能等待人工使用新 token 批准，批准前不得启动 formal fold0。\n\nState: AWAITING_HUMAN_ACCEPTANCE_DPR_GATE_A_R2\nApproval token: APPROVE_DPR_GATE_A_R2\nFormal fold0 authorized: false\nSuperseded tokens: APPROVE_DPR_GATE_A, APPROVE_DPR_GATE_A_R1\n\n关键证据：\n- 单一 shared encoder：CAREDPR.encoder 唯一；scar_branch / edema_branch 参数独立。\n- scar/edema 五类输出：p_coarse, q_fn, q_fp, p_refined, component_utility。\n- two-pass full-volume inference：pass1 聚合 shared feature 与 p_coarse/q_fn/q_fp；pass2 对每个完整体积 candidate 独立 crop/refine/utility。\n- diagnostic case 分离：optimizer cases 32；diagnostic cases 16；overlap 0；outer fold0 未使用。\n- proposal recall：scar p_coarse 0.925；edema p_coarse 1.000；q_fn/q_fp AUPRC 均高于 prevalence。\n- ROI/refiner：scar predicted ROI coverage 0.745；edema predicted ROI coverage 0.799；scar teacher/predicted Dice 1.000/0.283；edema 1.000/0.079。\n- component utility：真实 candidate 2482；positive/negative target 371/2111；AUROC 0.814；AUPRC 0.367；oracle gain 5.6273；realized gain 5.6148。\n- gradients：scar/edema p_coarse、q_fn/q_fp、refiner、utility 均为非零梯度；具体值见 mechanism_report。\n- hard-negative subtype：scar/edema 的 blood_pool、outside_support_bright_island、remote_anchor_fp、high_intensity_nonlesion 均非零。\n- no-T2：edema candidate/refiner/write-back exact zero。\n- component arbitration：whole-component REVISE parity PASS；zero accepted candidates exact anchor。\n- resume：same-stage reload exact；A2→B 边界不加载 A2 optimizer 到 B optimizer；参数值和固定输出 exact。\n- validators：tests PASS；known-bad PASS；strict validator PASS；consistency validator PASS。\n\nEvidence paths:\n- results/20260728_care_dpr_fold0_global_redesign/runtime/preflight/preflight_receipt.json\n- results/20260728_care_dpr_fold0_global_redesign/runtime/preflight/mechanism_report.json\n- results/20260728_care_dpr_fold0_global_redesign/runtime/preflight/sampler_audit_stage_preflight.json\n- results/20260728_care_dpr_fold0_global_redesign/strict_va